---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ISO 9001 Certification & Quality Management | Eurocert"
  description="ISO 9001 quality management system certification — gap analysis, ISO 9001 audits, process improvement, surveillance and recertification by Eurocert Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/management-system/iso-9001/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367536/eurocert/m2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 9001 Quality Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">International standard for quality management</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ISO 9001 — Quality Management System</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Framework for consistent quality in products and services.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">ISO 9001:2015 — <span class="text-euro-600">Quality Management System</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 9001:2015 is one of the most popular standards. The purpose of ISO 9001:2015 is to organize and create an operating framework for the Company in order to enable the Company to provide products and / or services based on customer needs. The ISO 9001:2015 standard is based on the Deming cycle and the concept of continuous improvement methodology known as «Plan-Do-Check-Act».</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ISO 9001:2015 can be implemented by all types of enterprises and organizations irrespective of their size and activity.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Objectives &amp; Benefits of Inspection</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Quality Management Systems Certification ensures that the company&#x27;s ongoing effort for continuous improvement in reducing potential risks in food importing and/or during the manufacturing process is publicly recognized. Certified companies have smoother business transactions and are in an advantageous position as far as competition is concerned.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Furthermore, the inspection process, a necessary step for certification, benefits companies by offering valuable insight in their processes which can encourage growth and improvement through remedial measures.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784094329/9001_iu3grj.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="ISO 9001 Quality Management"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Step by Step</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Certification <span class="text-euro-600">Process</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">ISO 9001:2015 Certification is provided by a Certification Body accredited to this standard.</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">01</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Application</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Company must decide on the type of certification and apply for it.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">02</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Pre-Assessment Inspection</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Certification Body provides an appropriate inspection team and performs a pre-assessment on-site inspection of the Quality Management System.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">03</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Documentation Review</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">During the pre-assessment inspection, the Certification Body checks the completeness of system documentation (manual, procedures, instructions, forms, etc.) and implementation (Archives) under the International Standard ISO 9001:2015.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">04</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Corrective Actions</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Deviations are recorded and the Company defines the appropriate period of time within which the necessary corrective actions will take place.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">05</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Assessment Audit</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Once the corrective actions have been taken, the Assessment inspection takes place, during which the system is audited as a whole and the completion of all corrective actions is checked.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-5 p-5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400 transition-colors duration-300"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-lg">06</span></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Certification Issued</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">If the Assessment inspection does not record any non-compliances to the standard ISO 9001:2015 then the Certification Body issues the ISO 9001:2015 Certification. In the case of recorded non-compliances the Company must take further corrective actions.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-white text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Required Documents</h3></div><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">During the Audit all the below are checked:</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>License of the Company and the accompanying documents</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>Other permits required</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>Organizational Structure / Chart</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>Objectives</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>Procedures</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-euro-600/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 text-[9px]"></i></div>Instructions for External Documents (eg Legislation)</li></ul></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-[#030a16] text-sm"></i></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Certificate Validity</h3></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Provided that the Assessment Audit of the Organization&#x27;s / Company&#x27;s Quality Management System is successful, the Certificate is issued shortly.</p><div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-eurogold-400/15 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 font-bold text-4xl block mb-1">3 Years</span><span class="text-slate-400 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Certificate Validity Period</span></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-4">During the three-year validity period, <strong class="text-slate-700">two annual surveillance audits</strong> must take place to maintain the certification.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">ISO 9001 <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ISO 9001 Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope verification and certification for Quality Management System requirements under ISO 9001.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Comprehensive Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Thorough on-site and documentation audits to evaluate your quality management system effectiveness.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert coaching and training for your teams on ISO 9001 implementation and quality best practices.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Compliance Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring and support to maintain your ISO 9001 certification and quality standards.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Professional quality documentation, process mapping, and management review reporting assistance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Remediation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fixing non-conformities and gaps identified during the quality management assessment process.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="lg:col-span-3"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Advantages</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8">Why Get ISO 9001 Certified?</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Regulatory Compliance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Meet all regulatory requirements for quality management systems.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-globe-europe text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Market Access</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Access markets requiring ISO 9001 certification worldwide.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Quality Assurance</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Demonstrate commitment to consistent product and service quality.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Competitive Advantage</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Stand out in your industry with internationally recognized certification.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:bg-white/4 transition-colors"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-1">Risk Management</h5><p class="text-white/40 text-xs leading-relaxed">Reduce compliance risks and improve operational efficiency.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 flex flex-col justify-center"><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Eurocert?</h3><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Our experienced auditors understand ISO 9001 requirements and can guide you through the certification process.</p><div class="grid grid-c